@ddd.bounded-context

Purpose:
  Explicit domain model boundary.

Owns: references\ddd\bounded-context.sdd
UseWhen:
  - large complex domain
  - different teams/models for subdomains
  - terminology conflicts exist

AvoidWhen:
  - small simple domain
  - single model sufficient

Why:
  Prevents model pollution by keeping contexts separate.

Related:
  @ddd.aggregate
  @architecture.modular-monolith

Examples:
  @project.core-banking
  @project.payment

State: +
